title: "Do published aflatoxin numbers recompute from their own open data?"
abstract: "We pre-registered checks of three aflatoxin studies from Kenya and Senegal against the data their authors deposited. 53 of 66 checks held, and most of the misses come down to definitions rather than errors. Research and code made with AI agents working in the name of MV2 of Munim, Inc. Code licensed Apache-2.0; text and data CC BY 4.0 unless a file says otherwise."
